        <dc:date>2020-09-29T09:09:10+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a risk assessment to a division e.g. Social Care, Primary Care, Acute Hospital, Mental Health, Health &amp; Wellbeing, HR etc.</rdfs:comment>
