        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Risks  which  may  contribute  to  the  physical  or  psychological  harm  of  an  individual.A type of Risk Impact Category described in the HSE Risk Assessment Tool.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Harm to a Person</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


