        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">National media/adverse publicity, less than 3 days. News stories &amp; features in national papers. Local media – long term adverse publicity.Public confidence in the organisation undermined. HSE use of resources questioned. Minister may make comment. Possible questions in the Dáil. Public calls (at national level) for specific remedial actions to be taken possible HSE review/investigation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Major Impact - Adverse Publicity/Reputation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#majorImpactBusinessContinuity -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#majorImpactBusinessContinuity">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#MajorImpact"/>
