        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-08-25T17:27:12+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Reduced quality of service user experience related to inadequate provision of information.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Negligible Impact - Service User Experience</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#open -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#open">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#RiskStatus"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Open, i.e. additional controls have been identified as necessary.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Open</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#operational -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#operational">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#RiskType"/>
        <dc:creator>Lucy McKenna</dc:creator>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-03-10T14:46:14+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment>As described in the HSE Integrated Risk Management Policy - Part 1, operational risks relate to the day-to-day delivery of activities, operational business plans and objectives. Operational risks typically have a short-term focus. Whilst they may impact a number of areas of the service, this does not necessarily make them a strategic risk. Operational risks may have the ability to impact strategic and other operational risks.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Operational</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#possible -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#possible">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#HSELikelihood"/>
        <actualFrequency>Occurs every 1-2 years</actualFrequency>
        <probability rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float">0.5</probability>
        <score rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</score>
        <dc:creator xml:lang="en">Rob Brennan</dc:creator>
        <dc:date xml:lang="en">2020-09-29T09:09:10+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Probability: 50%. Actual Frequency: Occurs every 1-2 years.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Possible</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#rareRemote -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#rareRemote">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#HSELikelihood"/>
        <actualFrequency>Occurs every 5 years</actualFrequency>
        <probability rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float">0.01</probability>
        <score rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</score>
        <dc:creator xml:lang="en">Rob Brennan</dc:creator>
        <dc:date xml:lang="en">2020-09-29T09:09:10+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Probability: 1%. Actual Frequency: Occurs every 5 years or more.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Rare/Remote</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serious -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serious">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Severity"/>
        <score rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</score>
        <dc:creator>Lucy McKenna</dc:creator>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-09-28T11:09:10+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Injury / harm that is of a temporary nature and results in more than 3 days absence but not more than 28 days.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Serious</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ImpactCategory"/>
        <dc:creator>Rob Brennan</dc:creator>
        <dc:date>2021-01-29T09:52:00+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Risks which threaten the delivery of a service provision to  service users in terms of quality, in a  comfortable,  caring  and  safe  environment,  delivered  in  a  calm  and reassuring  way;  having  information  to  make  choices,  to  feel  confident  and  to  feel  in  control;  being  listened  to  and talked  to as an  equal;  being treated with honesty, respect and dignity. A type of Risk Impact Category described in the HSE Risk Assessment Tool.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Service User Experience</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#stJamesHospital -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#stJamesHospital">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Organisation"/>
        <dc:creator>Lucy McKenna</dc:creator>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-03-26T14:14:51+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">St. James&apos;s Hospital</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#stewartsCare -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#stewartsCare">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Organisation"/>
        <dc:creator>Lucy McKenna</dc:creator>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-03-26T14:15:12+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Stewarts Care</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#strategic -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#strategic">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#RiskType"/>
        <dc:creator>Lucy McKenna</dc:creator>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-03-10T14:45:13+00:00</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment>As described in the HSE Integrated Risk Management Policy - Part 1, a strategic risk has the ability to impact on the achievement/delivery of the HSE’s strategic objectives/directions. Strategic risks relate to the highest level of objective for the HSE, which typically have a long-term focus and are linked to the HSE’s Strategic Plan.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Strategic</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#tusla -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#tusla">
